<h3>Candidate and Campaign Information</h3>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel-content">
<p>Looking for campaign information? You're in the right place! Run for office or place a question on the ballot, track initiatives and candidates, search for campaign finance records, submit reports and more on our <a href="https://www.denvergov.org/Government/Agencies-Departments-Offices/Agencies-Departments-Offices-Directory/Denver-Clerk-and-Recorder/Elections-Division/Campaign-Candidate-Resources">Campaign and Candidate Resource Page</a>.</p>
