<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel">
<h3>Learn how Denver Runs Its Elections</h3>
<div class="oc-wysiwyg-container-panel-content">
<p>Security and accuracy are paramount to the elections operation in Denver. Every step of the process, starting with collection and ending with tabulation, is done by a&nbsp;<strong>bipartisan team</strong>. <a href="https://www.denvergov.org/Government/Agencies-Departments-Offices/Agencies-Departments-Offices-Directory/Denver-Clerk-and-Recorder/Elections-Division/How-We-Run-Elections">Learn more</a> how Denver conducts it's elections securely.</p>
